chanized Brigade was injured at a position that could not be reached by conventional evacuation means due to heavy enemy drone activity and mines. Specialists from the ", "link": "https://t.me/DefenderDome/23484", "pubDate": "2026-10-19T21:13:52+00:00"}, {"channel": "combat_ftg2", "snippet": "Ukraine\u2019s Defense Forces have reportedly carried out the world\u2019s first aerial drone evacuation of a wounded soldier from the front line. A soldier from the 30th Mechanized Brigade was wounded at his position. Due to the high density of enemy drones and extensive mining, evacuation by ground robotic system was impossible. Fighters from the 92nd Assault Brigade\u2019s ground robotic systems company came ", "snippet_en": "Ukraine\u2019s Defense Forces have reportedly carried out the world\u2019s first aerial drone evacuation of a wounded soldier from the front line. A soldier from the 30th Mechanized Brigade was wounded at his position. Due to the high density of enemy drones and extensive mining, evacuation by ground robotic system was impossible. Fighters from the 92nd Assault Brigade\u2019s ground robotic systems company came ", "link": "https://t.me/combat_ftg2/3718", "pubDate": "2026-10-18T20:36:25+00:00"}, {"channel": "serhii_flash", "snippet": "\u041a\u043e\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0456 \u0431\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0432\u0456\u0437\u0443\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0440\u0435\u0437\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0430\u0442 \u0440\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0431\u0435\u0437\u043f\u0456\u043b\u043e\u0442\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0456\u0432, \u044f \u0437\u0430\u0432\u0436\u0434\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u043c\u0438\u0441\u043b\u044e\u044e\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u043e\u0440\u0433\u0430\u043d\u0456\u0437\u0430\u0446\u0456\u0439\u043d\u043e-\u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u0456\u0447\u043d\u043e\u044e \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u043e\u044e. \u0429\u043e\u0431 \u0434\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0442\u0456\u0442\u0438 \u0434\u043e